OK   When the colleague declines an invitation, the sharing service shall set the status of the invitation to `declined`.
OK   When the owner withdraws an invitation, the sharing service shall set the status of the invitation to `withdrawn`.
OK   While an invitation is `accepted`, when the owner withdraws the invitation, the sharing service shall hide the note of the invitation.
